        <!--
          Latch-side sensor clearance.

          Gate closed edge:       x = 0.6000 m
          Fixed-post inner face:  x = 0.6200 m
          Clearance:                  0.0200 m

          The outer post face remains at x = 0.7000 m so the
          stationary fence geometry on this side is unchanged.
        -->
