      <!-- ==================================================
           FOUR PNP PROXIMITY SENSORS

           Stationary side: fixed RIGHT gate post
           Moving side:     metal targets on safety gate

           20 mm available latch clearance.

           Sensor body depth: 10 mm
           Air gap:            5 mm
           Target thickness:   4 mm

           No physical contact occurs.
           ================================================== -->

